es of traps \n- 40 challenging levels (5 in demo) \n- 4 different locations (1 in demo)", "short_description": "Its physically based game. You have to fight with the forces of gravity and overcome the traps."}]}, "developer_name": "RaptorsGames", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "http://raptorsgames.com/privacypolicy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "http://raptorsgames.com/privacypolicy.html", "publisher_name": "RaptorsGames", "support_website_url": "http://raptorsgames.com/", "website_url": "http://raptorsgames.com/", "category": "GAMES", "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": null, "context_topics": [], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": ["ARCADE", "PUZZLE", "ADVENTURE"], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": null, "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["GEAR_VR_CONTROLLER"], "supported_player_modes": [], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "601165571217043"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2026672907410281"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "2026672907410281"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1550167200, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "2026672907410281"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "2321396854551608", "version": "1.0"}, "id": "383778315710626", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"nodes": [{"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "__isAppBinary": "AndroidBinary", "binary_application": {"__typename": "Application", "id": "2289190954438865", "is_concept": false, "latest_released_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "id": "2321396854551608"}, "release_status": "RELEASED"}, "binary_releas